  <title lang="en">Zero-Knowledge Proof (Fiat-Shamir): Visualization</title>
  <summary lang="en"><i>Zero-Knowledge Proof (Fiat-Shamir): Visualization</i></summary>
  <description lang="en">Peggy proves that she knows a secret in three rounds; a cheater who does not know it is caught.</description>
  <keywords lang="en">zero-knowledge, Fiat-Shamir, identification, proof, visualization</keywords>
  <replacements lang="en">
    <replacement key="$random number generator$" value="RandomNumberGenerator" />
    <replacement key="$output$" value="Random bytes" />
    <replacement key="$memo$" value="The parameters are the primes 11 and 13, the secret 5 and for every round the random number of Peggy and the challenge of Victor (7 and 1, 9 and 0, 2 and 1). Change the challenges to 0 to see that a cheater then gets through." />
  </replacements>
  <!--- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -->
